#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:9
msgid "Optional storage, cryptography, frames and F4 handoff"
msgstr "可选存储、密码功能、帧与 F4 跳转交接"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:11
msgid ""
"Public generic mechanisms are separate from concrete MCU adapters. Current "
"production integration is F4; retired H5/H7/U5 adapters are not selected "
"merely because their vendor libraries remain in the repository. Physical HIL "
"is not executed and source presence does not create a software candidate."
msgstr ""
"公共通用机制与具体 MCU 适配器分别维护。当前生产集成是 F4；保留厂商库不会使退役的 H5/H7/U5 适配器自动入选。物理 HIL "
"尚未执行，存在源码不等于形成软件候选。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "机制"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "Current boundary"
msgstr "当前边界"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "Mapped storage owner"
msgstr "映射存储所有者"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid ""
"Caller-owned slots, exact epochs and a sole writer; explicit host model where"
" selected"
msgstr "调用方持有的槽位、精确 epoch 与唯一写入者；选用时显式使用主机模型"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "AMP IPC core"
msgstr "AMP IPC 核心"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid ""
