"current production dual-core adapter"
msgstr "公共 lane/epoch/cache 合同，启动与一致性证明由外部提供；当前没有生产双核适配器"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "Frame layout"
msgstr "帧布局"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid ""
"Public dimensions, stride and full-frame loans; no retained H743 DMA2D "
"adapter"
msgstr "公共尺寸、步长与整帧借用；未保留 H743 DMA2D 适配器"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "Cipher and hash"
msgstr "加解密与哈希"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid ""
"F415ZG/F417ZG selected CRYP/HASH owners; explicit byte spans and cleanup"
", without a key store or protocol policy"
msgstr "F415ZG/F417ZG 已选 CRYP/HASH 所有者；显式字节范围与清理，不提供密钥库或协议策略"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "F407 tail handoff"
msgstr "F407 尾跳转交接"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:0
msgid "Exact baremetal VE/ZG preconditions below; not live RTOS adoption"
msgstr "以下给出 baremetal VE/ZG 的精确前提；不支持接管运行中的 RTOS"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:24
msgid ""
"Accepted asynchronous operations retain metadata and buffer loans until "
"acquire-observed SETTLED. Cancel and deadlines request withdrawal; callers "
"continue required service. Failed drain retains storage and recovery duties. "
"Observers and controls must also be joined before their own storage is "
"reused."
msgstr ""
"异步操作接纳后，保留元数据与缓冲区借用，直到通过 acquire 语义观测到 SETTLED。取消和 deadline "
"请求退出；调用方继续提供所需服务。排空失败时继续保留存储与恢复责任。复用观察者和控制对象自身的存储前，也必须等待它们退出。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:29
msgid "Mapped ownership and frame storage"
msgstr "映射所有权与帧存储"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:31
msgid ""
"The mapped owner serializes one writer against all aperture readers. Copying "
"a token creates no new loan, epochs do not wrap, and a failed final unmap "
"retains the exact cleanup token. No CPU, DMA or cache writer may bypass the "
"selected backend. A host NOR model establishes software rules, not physical "
"QSPI, XIP, cache or Flash qualification."
msgstr ""
"映射所有者使单个写入者与所有映射窗口读取者互斥。复制 token 不产生新借用，epoch 不回绕，最终解除映射失败时保留精确清理 token。任何 "
"CPU、DMA 或 cache 写入者都不得绕过所选后端。主机 NOR 模型建立的是软件规则，不赋予物理 QSPI、XIP、cache 或 Flash "
"资格。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:37
msgid ""
"Frame contracts validate complete storage extents, format and stride. A "
"format conversion API or generic frame description does not establish an MCU "
"accelerator or Board connection. Storage and execution progress stay caller-"
"owned."
msgstr ""
"帧合同验证完整存储范围、格式与步长。格式转换 API 或通用帧描述不能证明存在 MCU 加速器或 Board 接线。存储与执行推进仍由调用方负责。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:41
msgid "Selected F415/F417 cryptographic engines"
msgstr "已选 F415/F417 密码引擎"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:43
msgid ""
"`cipher.h` and `hash.h` expose separate two-pointer interfaces with shar"
"ed read-only operations. The typed factory returns statically selected o"
"bjects; neither lookup nor query acquires clocks or starts hardware. The"
" F415ZG and F417ZG [software references](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/ne"
"xus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_crypto/f415z"
"g.toml) select the existing `irq-blocks` mode. F405/F407 do not acquire "
"these engines merely because the same vendor family library contains the"
"ir implementation."
msgstr ""
"`cipher.h` 与 `hash.h` 提供相互独立、各含两个指针的接口，并共享只读操作表。强类型 factory 返回静态选定的对象；查找"
"和查询都不会取得时钟或启动硬件。F415ZG 与 F417ZG 的[软件参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nex"
"us/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_crypto/f415zg"
".toml)选择现有 `irq-blocks` 模式。F405/F407 不会仅因同一厂商系列库包含其实现，就取得这些引擎。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:50
msgid ""
"CRYP supplies AES ECB/CBC/CTR and DES/TDES ECB/CBC. Query reports the ac"
"tual key sizes, alignment, request granularity and in-place support. Thi"
"s provider requires whole blocks, including CTR; the public interface pe"
"rmits future providers to report byte-tail support without changing the "
"ownership contract. Keys and IVs use algorithm byte order rather than ve"
"ndor word types. The platform does not generate IVs, pad messages, authe"
"nticate ciphertext or select product algorithms. SHA1, MD5 and their HMA"
"C variants describe the capabilities of this HASH IP; they do not imply "
"SHA256, AEAD or a TLS acceleration binding."
msgstr ""
"CRYP 提供 AES ECB/CBC/CTR 和 DES/TDES ECB/CBC。查询报告实际密钥长度、对齐、请求粒度和原位操作支持。此 p"
"rovider 要求完整数据块，CTR 也不例外；公共接口允许未来 provider 在不改变所有权合同的前提下，报告对不足整块尾部字节的支持。"
"密钥和 IV 使用算法规定的字节顺序，不使用厂商的字类型。平台不生成 IV、不填充消息、不认证密文，也不选择产品算法。SHA1、MD5 及其 H"
"MAC 变体描述的是该 HASH IP 的能力；不表示支持 SHA256、AEAD 或 TLS 加速绑定。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:59
msgid ""
"One privileged task serializes each engine. ACCEPTED borrows the request"
" and every referenced input, output, key and IV until acquire-observed S"
"ETTLED. Inputs cannot overlap mutable request, provider or System storag"
"e; output cannot overwrite key/IV or partially overlap input. Cipher fai"
"lures can leave an explicitly counted output prefix. A digest is valid o"
"nly on SUCCESS. Cancel and deadline select a terminal cause; neither rel"
"eases the loan early."
msgstr ""
"每个引擎由一个特权任务串行驱动。ACCEPTED 后，请求及其引用的每个输入、输出、密钥和 IV 都保持借用，直到通过 acquire 语义观测"
"到 SETTLED。输入不能与可变请求、provider 或 System 存储重叠；输出不能覆盖密钥/IV，也不能与输入部分重叠。加解密失败时"
"，可能留下明确计数的输出前缀。仅在 SUCCESS 时摘要才有效。取消和 deadline 只选择终止原因，均不会提前释放借用。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:66
msgid ""
"CRYP uses the official HAL interrupt transport. HASH uses official initi"
"alization and a bounded C FIFO protocol because the selected HAL transpo"
"rt assumes padded word reads and can wait while advancing HMAC phases. E"
"ach service call reads only bytes inside the declared spans; a partial f"
"inal word is assembled locally. HMAC needs explicit task service between"
" phases, even when no final-digest IRQ has arrived. There is no full-mes"
"sage copy, queue or implicit worker."
msgstr ""
"CRYP 使用官方 HAL 中断传输。HASH 使用官方初始化与有界 C FIFO 协议，因为所选 HAL 传输假定可读取填充后的整字，并可能在"
"推进 HMAC 阶段时等待。每次 service 调用仅读取声明范围内的字节；最后不足一字的数据在本地组装。HMAC 在各阶段之间需要显式任务侧"
" service，即使最终摘要 IRQ 尚未到达也如此。没有整条消息复制、队列或隐式 worker。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:73
msgid ""
"Every terminal path withdraws IRQ and peripheral references, clears prov"
"ider scratch and HAL pointers, and proves the exclusive hardware reset t"
"hat removes key, context and FIFO residue. A refused reset or withdrawal"
" retains QUARANTINED storage for recovery. Caller-owned key bytes are no"
"t erased by the provider. CRYP owns IRQ79; HASH owns only its source on "
"shared HASH/RNG IRQ80. The currently selected RNG path polls, and a futu"
"re IRQ RNG transport must join the same vector owner rather than indepen"
"dently disable or clear it."
msgstr ""
"每条终止路径都撤销 IRQ 和外设引用，清除 provider 暂存与 HAL 指针，并证明已完成独占硬件复位，以去除密钥、上下文和 FIFO "
"残留。若复位或退出被拒绝，则保留 QUARANTINED 存储以供恢复。provider 不擦除调用方持有的密钥字节。CRYP 拥有 IRQ79"
"；HASH 仅拥有共享 HASH/RNG IRQ80 中属于自己的中断源。当前选定的 RNG 路径使用轮询；未来的 IRQ RNG 传输必须加入"
"同一向量所有者，不能独立禁用或清除该向量。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:81
msgid ""
"Models exercise the real C transport, ownership and failures. ARM refere"
"nces check exact headers, static factory, linked methods and resource bu"
"dgets. Neither result establishes silicon known-answer tests, throughput"
", side-channel properties or physical qualification. Source SDK consumer"
"s use the same public references and do not gain access to vendor handle"
"s or private configuration."
msgstr ""
"模型验证实际 C 传输、所有权和失败路径。ARM 参考检查精确头文件、静态 factory、链接方法和资源预算。这些结果均不证明在芯片上执行过已"
"知答案测试，也不证明吞吐量、侧信道特性或物理资格。Source SDK 消费者复用相同公共参考，不能因此取得厂商 Handle 或私有配置的访问"
"权。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:87
msgid "F407 masked tail handoff and clock barrier"
msgstr "F407 屏蔽中断尾跳与时钟 barrier"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:89
msgid ""
"The F407 handoff component reuses the ClockDomain barrier. Enroll every "
"actual owner, close admission, cancel/drain/join users, stop Platform and "
"release exact leases. An empty foreign domain, stale epoch or retained lease "
"rejects; the domain cannot discover unenrolled users or other masters."
msgstr ""
"F407 交接组件复用 ClockDomain 屏障。登记每个实际所有者，关闭接纳，取消、排空并等待使用者退出，停止 Platform "
"并释放精确租约。外来空 domain、过期 epoch 或仍被持有的租约均拒绝；domain 无法发现未登记的使用者或其他主设备。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:94
msgid ""
"The caller enters privileged MSP Thread with PRIMASK set and BASEPRI, "
"FAULTMASK and CONTROL clear. It establishes stopped System, HSI16/reset "
"buses, no active FP/lazy context or MPU, no live SysTick/NVIC/peripheral/DMA "
"and idle Flash with ART/prefetch disabled. Reject before writes; reading "
"SysTick CTRL consumes COUNTFLAG. Validate the exact Flash density, aligned "
"vector table, SRAM MSP and Thumb PC. Shared device ID does not prove full "
"part or PCB identity."
msgstr ""
"调用方进入特权 MSP Thread，置位 PRIMASK，并清零 BASEPRI、FAULTMASK 和 CONTROL。必须建立 System "
"已停止、HSI16/复位总线、无活动 FP/lazy 上下文或 MPU、无活动 SysTick/NVIC/外设/DMA，以及 Flash 空闲且 "
"ART/prefetch 关闭的状态。拒绝必须发生在写入之前；读取 SysTick CTRL 会消耗 COUNTFLAG。验证精确 Flash "
"容量、对齐的向量表、SRAM MSP 和 Thumb PC。共享 device ID 不能证明完整料号或 PCB 身份。"

#: docs/design/io-extension-boundaries.md:101
msgid ""
"Successful tail transfer never returns. It replaces VTOR/MSP and branches "
"while masked; target startup must accept that entry and reset controllers "
"before enabling gates. Authentication, image selection, partitions, "
"NMI/debugger/master exclusion and recovery remain external. Live RTOS/FPU "
"adoption, DVFS and deep STOP continuity are not supplied by this handoff."
msgstr ""
"成功的尾跳转交接永不返回。它在保持屏蔽的状态下替换 VTOR/MSP "
"并跳转；目标启动代码必须接受该入口，并在启用门控前复位控制器。认证、镜像选择、分区、NMI/调试器/其他主设备排除和恢复仍由外部负责。此交接不提供运行中 "
"RTOS/FPU 接管、DVFS 或深 STOP 连续性。"

